    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's a good start. pretty punchy. \n\ncan you add a section where he talks about how all these big international organizations and government bureaucrats are trying to tell us how to live our lives—like with all these new regulations and globalist policies—and how it's just a way to strip away our individual freedom? make it sound like he's really connecting with the average person who feels left behind.",
